# doubt-solver.ai — Super Cost-Saving Architecture Plan

A Duolingo-style education platform for school students featuring AI-powered exam prep, self-assessment, scoring, and personalized recommendations — backed by a RAG-enhanced AI model.

---

## 🎯 Core Product Features

| Feature | Description |
|---|---|
| **Exam Preparation** | AI generates topic-wise study material, flashcards, and summaries |
| **Self-Assessment Exams** | AI generates MCQ / short-answer tests based on syllabus |
| **Scoring & Analytics** | Instant scoring with topic-level performance breakdown |
| **Smart Recommendations** | AI recommends weak-area practice based on score patterns |
| **Gamification** | XP, streaks, leaderboards, badges, levels — Duolingo-style |
| **RAG-Powered Knowledge** | Textbooks & NCERT content indexed for contextual AI answers |

---

## 💰 Cost-Saving Philosophy

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The #1 rule: **Never pay for idle compute.** Use serverless, pay-per-use services, and open-source models wherever possible. Target **< ₹15,000/month** ($180) for the first 10,000 users.

### Key Cost Principles
1. **Serverless-first** — Zero cost when no one is using it
2. **Open-source LLMs** — Use DeepSeek / Gemma / Llama via free/cheap APIs
3. **Edge caching** — Cache AI-generated questions & material aggressively
4. **Static frontend** — Host on Vercel/Cloudflare Pages for free
5. **Managed free-tier databases** — Supabase / Neon / PlanetScale

---

