## 🎮 Gamification System Design (Duolingo-Inspired)

### XP & Leveling

```
Level 1:     0 XP    (Beginner)
Level 2:   100 XP    (Explorer)
Level 3:   300 XP    (Scholar)
Level 4:   600 XP    (Expert)
Level 5: 1,000 XP    (Champion)
Level 6: 1,500 XP    (Legend)
...continues exponentially
```

**XP Earning:**
- Complete a practice set → +10 XP
- Score 80%+ on exam → +25 XP bonus
- Perfect score → +50 XP bonus
- Maintain streak → +5 XP/day bonus
- First exam of the day → +15 XP

### Streak System
- 🔥 Daily streak counter (consecutive days of activity)
- ❄️ Streak Freeze (1 free, then earn via XP)
- 🏅 Streak milestones (7-day, 30-day, 100-day badges)

### Leaderboard & Leagues
- Weekly leagues: Bronze → Silver → Gold → Platinum → Diamond
- Top 10 promoted, Bottom 5 demoted each week
- Separate leaderboards per grade/board

### Achievement Badges
- 🎯 "Sharp Shooter" — 5 perfect scores
- 📚 "Bookworm" — Complete 50 study sessions
- 🔥 "On Fire" — 30-day streak
- 🧠 "Subject Master" — Score 90%+ in all topics of a subject
- 🏆 "Diamond Champion" — Reach Diamond league

