## 💸 Total Monthly Cost Estimate

| Component | Service | Monthly Cost |
|---|---|---|
| Frontend Hosting | Vercel Free | ₹0 |
| Auth | Supabase Auth Free | ₹0 |
| Database | Supabase Postgres Free | ₹0 |
| Caching | Upstash Redis Free | ₹0 |
| API Functions | Supabase Edge Functions | ₹0 |
| Vector DB | pgvector (Supabase) | ₹0 |
| Object Storage | Cloudflare R2 Free | ₹0 |
| **AI (LLM calls)** | **Gemini Flash + DeepSeek** | **₹500–2,000** |
| **DNS + Domain** | **.ai domain** | **₹500/month amortized** |
| **Total** | | **₹1,000 – ₹2,500/month** |

> [!CAUTION]
> The ₹1,000–₹2,500/month estimate is for **up to 10,000 users**. Beyond that, Supabase Pro ($25/mo) and more LLM API budget will be needed. But by then, you should have revenue.

