## 🚀 Recommended Build Phases

### Phase 1 — MVP (4–6 weeks)
- [ ] Auth + user profiles (grade, board selection)
- [ ] 1 subject with AI-generated MCQ exams
- [ ] Scoring + basic analytics
- [ ] XP + streak system
- [ ] Basic Duolingo-style UI with animations

### Phase 2 — Core Features (4–6 weeks)
- [ ] RAG-powered doubt solving
- [ ] AI study material generation
- [ ] Leaderboards + leagues
- [ ] Multiple subjects + boards (CBSE, ICSE, State)
- [ ] Badge/achievement system

### Phase 3 — Growth (6–8 weeks)
- [ ] PWA + offline mode
- [ ] Push notifications (streak reminders)
- [ ] Teacher/parent dashboard
- [ ] Community notes (student-contributed)
- [ ] Referral system

### Phase 4 — Monetization
- [ ] Freemium model (3 exams/day free, unlimited with sub)
- [ ] Premium AI features (detailed explanations, custom exams)
- [ ] School/institution bulk licensing
- [ ] Ad-supported free tier

---

## 🔒 Scaling Escape Plan

When you outgrow free tiers:

| Trigger | Action | Cost |
|---|---|---|
| 500MB DB full | Supabase Pro | $25/mo |
| 50K MAU exceeded | Supabase Pro (included) | $25/mo |
| Heavy AI usage | Add OpenRouter load-balancing | $50–100/mo |
| 100K+ users | Move to Railway/Fly.io | $50/mo |
| Need mobile app | React Native (reuse Next.js components) | Dev time only |

---

## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
Since this is an architecture document (no code yet), no automated tests apply at this stage.

### Manual Verification
- **User review**: Verify the architecture meets all product requirements
- **Cost validation**: Cross-check free tier limits on Supabase, Vercel, Cloudflare, and LLM APIs
- **Scalability review**: Confirm the scaling escape plan covers realistic growth scenarios
